## Model card

- **Name:** QoDuck
- **Short description:** Alibaba/Qoder stealth coding and reasoning preview model (suspected Qwen-family checkpoint per local metadata) with adaptive thinking and large context, available in Qoder environments.
- **Provider / access:** Qoder desktop/platform preview surfaces. Local metadata lists `opencode/qoduck` with free daily preview allowance in Qoder desktop.
- **Release / knowledge:** Stealth preview; release date and knowledge cutoff not publicly documented in reviewed sources.
- **IDs:** `qoduck` (local/preview identifier).
- **Context window:** 1,048,576 total tokens (65,536 max output) per local metadata; not independently verified from reviewed official page.
- **Modalities:** Text and image input; text and code output per local metadata.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** Free preview tier (0.0x credits) in Qoder desktop per local metadata; hosted pricing outside preview not documented in reviewed sources.
- **Architecture:** Undisclosed/stealth; architecture and parameter count not publicly disclosed.

